{"seq":3,"slug":"implicational-universals","title":"蕴含共性与语言普遍性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/linguistic-typology/foundations/implicational-universals","wordCount":1673,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"蕴含共性与语言普遍性\">蕴含共性与语言普遍性</h1><p>格林伯格在 1963 年那篇论文里写下的不是&quot;所有语言都 X&quot;，而是&quot;如果一种语言 X，那么它倾向于 Y&quot;。这个看似谦逊的句式，是现代类型学最锋利的工具。因为绝对普遍性（所有语言都有元音）虽真，却太弱，几乎不约束变异；而蕴含共性恰恰相反——它不禁止 X，也不禁止 Y，只禁止&quot;有 X 却无 Y&quot;这一种组合。一条蕴含共性就划掉了逻辑上四种可能组合中的一种，把貌似无序的跨语言变异压缩成有限的几种可能。类型学的解释力，主要就来自把这种&quot;被禁止的组合&quot;一条条找出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语言普遍性按两个维度分类：是不是无例外（绝对 vs. 倾向），以及是不是带条件（无条件 vs. 蕴含）。四种组合各有其分量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>绝对（无例外）</th>\n<th>倾向（统计）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>无条件</strong></td>\n<td>绝对无条件共性<br>例：所有语言都有元音和辅音</td>\n<td>统计无条件共性<br>例：多数语言辅音多于元音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蕴含（有条件）</strong></td>\n<td>绝对蕴含共性<br>例：若有双数则必有复数</td>\n<td>统计蕴含共性<br>例：若 OV 则倾向后置词</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四类共性的约束力与可证伪性差异很大，下表把它们并置对照，免得把&quot;倾向&quot;当成&quot;铁律&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>例证</th>\n<th>反例一例即推翻？</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对无条件共性</td>\n<td>所有语言都有元音和辅音</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计无条件共性</td>\n<td>多数语言辅音多于元音</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对蕴含共性</td>\n<td>若有双数则必有复数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计蕴含共性</td>\n<td>若 OV 则倾向后置词</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>蕴含共性的逻辑形式是&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\rightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;。它的关键性质在于：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 各自有无构成的四格表里，它只断言一个格子应当为空（有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 而无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>），其余三格都允许。下图把这一逻辑画出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;蕴含共性 P→Q&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;有P有Q&lt;br/&gt;允许&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;无P有Q&lt;br/&gt;允许&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;无P无Q&lt;br/&gt;允许&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;有P无Q&lt;br/&gt;被禁止&lt;br/&gt;这一格应为空&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;找到该格的语言&lt;br/&gt;即为反例&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"蕴含共性 P→Q\"] --&gt; B[\"有P有Q&lt;br/&gt;允许\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"无P有Q&lt;br/&gt;允许\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"无P无Q&lt;br/&gt;允许\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"有P无Q&lt;br/&gt;被禁止&lt;br/&gt;这一格应为空\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"找到该格的语言&lt;br/&gt;即为反例\"]</pre><h2 id=\"四格表与单向蕴含\">四格表与单向蕴含</h2><p>检验一条蕴含共性，标准做法是建一张二乘二的四格表，把样本里每种语言按&quot;有无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;和&quot;有无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;归入四格之一。若共性成立，&quot;有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 而无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;那一格应当为空或近乎为空，其余三格可以有语言。这一点常被误解：蕴含共性绝不预测四格里只有&quot;有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;一格非空，恰恰相反，&quot;无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;和&quot;无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;都允许，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 不出现时共性对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 不作任何约束。</p>\n<p>以语序为例，&quot;若一种语言是宾动语序（OV），则它倾向使用后置词&quot;这条共性，预测的是&quot;OV 且用前置词&quot;的语言应当稀少。检验时把样本按 OV/VO 与后置词/前置词分成四格，去数那个被禁格里有多少语言。这种语序间的相关性是格林伯格共性的主体，其完整内容见 <a href=\"../morphosyntactic-types/word-order-typology\">语序类型与语序和谐</a>。</p>\n<p>要注意蕴含是单向的：&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\rightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;不等于&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q \\rightarrow P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;。OV 蕴含后置词，不意味着后置词蕴含 OV。把单向蕴含读成双向，是另一个高频错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蕴含层级-把多条蕴含串起来\">蕴含层级：把多条蕴含串起来</h2><p>当一组特征之间存在一连串蕴含时，它们会排成一条蕴含层级（implicational hierarchy）。最著名的例子是数的层级：单数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 复数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 双数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 三数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span></span></span></span></span> 少数。它读作：一种语言若在某位置有形态区分，则必在其左侧所有位置也有区分。换句话说，有双数必有复数，有三数必有双数和复数，但反之不必。整条层级用一组嵌套的蕴含，把&quot;哪些数范畴组合可能存在&quot;约束成寥寥几种。</p>\n<p>层级的威力在于它同时做两件事：既预测哪些组合不可能（跳过左侧直接拥有右侧），又预测了&quot;实现顺序&quot;——语言获得或失去范畴时会沿层级的某一端推进。语义领域里也满是这种层级：名词短语可及性层级支配着关系化（见 <a href=\"../categories-domains/relative-clauses-subordination\">关系从句与从属结构</a>），颜色词层级支配着基本颜色词的增加（见 <a href=\"../categories-domains/semantic-typology-numerals-color\">语义类型学（数词与颜色词）</a>）。可以说，蕴含层级是类型学跨越形态、句法、语义各领域反复出现的统一表达式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反例-显著性与解释\">反例、显著性与解释</h2><p>绝对蕴含共性只要一个真反例就被推翻——这就是为什么寻找反例的研究偏爱大而杂的方便样本（见 <a href=\"language-sampling-methods\">语言样本与抽样方法</a>）。但绝大多数共性是统计倾向而非铁律，于是问题变成：被禁格里有三五种语言，到底算反例足以否证，还是算噪声不必在意？</p>\n<p>这就需要统计显著性检验。把四格表的观察频数与&quot;两特征相互独立时的期望频数&quot;相比，用卡方检验或费舍尔精确检验判断偏离是否显著。若被禁格的语言数显著低于独立假设下的期望，这条蕴含就被认定为有统计支持，而非样本的偶然产物。当代基于大数据库的研究还会更进一步，在检验时把语系与区域作为协变量控制掉，以免相关性其实来自共同祖先或区域接触——这套定量方法是 <a href=\"../explanation-frontiers/quantitative-typology-databases\">定量类型学与大规模数据库</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>而一旦一条蕴含被确认，真正的问题才开始：为什么是这个方向、这个组合被禁止？对此的回答属于功能解释——加工难度、交际效率、形式经济性等（见 <a href=\"../explanation-frontiers/functional-explanation\">类型学的功能解释</a>）。蕴含共性是类型学的发现，功能动机是对这些发现的解释，二者构成这门学科的一体两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>蕴含共性的形式是单向的&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\rightarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;，只禁止&quot;有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 而无 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;一种组合，因而比绝对无条件共性约束力强得多。</li>\n<li>普遍性按&quot;绝对/倾向&quot;与&quot;无条件/蕴含&quot;两维分四类；类型学最有产出的是蕴含共性，其中多数是统计倾向。</li>\n<li>四格表是检验工具，被禁格应为空，其余三格允许；蕴含是单向的，不可读成双向。</li>\n<li>多条蕴含可串成蕴含层级（数、可及性、颜色词层级），既约束可能组合，又预测范畴的获得/失去顺序。</li>\n<li>统计共性需用卡方或费舍尔检验判断反例是否显著，当代研究还需控制语系与区域；确认共性后再追问其功能动机。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蕴含共性与语言普遍性","id":"蕴含共性与语言普遍性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四格表与单向蕴含","id":"四格表与单向蕴含"},{"level":2,"text":"蕴含层级：把多条蕴含串起来","id":"蕴含层级-把多条蕴含串起来"},{"level":2,"text":"反例、显著性与解释","id":"反例-显著性与解释"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"语言样本与抽样方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/linguistic-typology/foundations/language-sampling-methods"},"next":{"title":"形态类型（孤立·黏着·屈折·多式综合）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/linguistic-typology/morphosyntactic-types/morphological-types"}}